OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans tackle 23-mile walk
OL,4,Afor veterans charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 45 Brighton and Hove Albion
OL,7,Fand Portsmouth Football Club supporters
OL,8,Fhave set off on a 23-mile (37km)
OL,9,Fwalking tour in Normandy to raise money
OL,10,Ffor Blind Veterans UK.
OL,12,FThe group, which left from Portsmouth
OL,13,Fon Thursday night after watching
OL,14,FBrighton draw in the Europa Conference
OL,15,FLeague, also includes five blind
OL,16,Fveterans.
OL,18,FBefore returning home on Sunday they
OL,19,Fwill visit a number of significant
OL,20,Fsites, including Pegasus Bridge,
OL,21,FVer-sur-Mer and the British Normandy
OL,22,FMemorial.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
