OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans tackle 23-mile walk
OL,4,Afor veterans charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Steve Darby said the group
OL,7,Fwere going to pay their "respects to
OL,8,Fthose who didn't make it" and "those
OL,9,Fthat came back and suffered with eye
OL,10,Floss and other conditions".
